ot resolve whether consecutive hops fall within the 600-unit relay limit, so no genuine time-respecting chain could be confirmed or excluded with the available budget.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 22396, "total_output_tokens": 3950, "total_tokens": 26346, "total_latency_ms": 59321, "llm_calls": 5, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}